SCOPE CONTRACT 1: TWS Category Removal
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

OBJECTIVE: Remove True Wireless (TWS) category and archive associated products
CURRENT STATE: Category exists at slug "true-wireless-tws", ID: sbbu2eig5fx84uht05ic863j
TARGET STATE: Category removed, products archived, semantic rules removed

--- LAYER 1: Product Archiving (MUST complete before category removal) ---

DoD 1.1: Identify all TWS-assigned products
  □ Query Sanity: *[_type == "product" && "sbbu2eig5fx84uht05ic863j" in catalogueLocationKeys]{_id, name, brand}
  □ Export product list to _project/tws-products-archive-list.json
  □ VERIFY: List has < 100 items (manual reviewable)
  □ TEST: Count matches expected (run: node scripts/vfs-semantic-audit.mjs)

DoD 1.2: Create archive migration script
  □ SCRIPT: scripts/migrate-tws-to-archive.mjs
    - For each TWS product:
      a. Copy to _type == "archivedProduct"
      b. Set archiveReason: "Category removed - off-theme (TWS)"
      c. Set archivedAt: new Date().toISOString()
      d. Keep all other fields intact
  □ TEST: Script runs in --dry-run mode showing what would change
  □ TEST: No errors during execution

DoD 1.3: Execute archive migration
  □ BACKUP: Export affected products to sanity/backups/tws-archive-backup.json
  □ RUN: node scripts/migrate-tws-to-archive.mjs
  □ VERIFY: Original products have _type changed to "archivedProduct"
  □ VERIFY: No products remain with TWS key in catalogueLocationKeys
  □ TEST: Query returns 0 results: *[_type == "product" && "sbbu2eig5fx84uht05ic863j" in catalogueLocationKeys]

--- LAYER 2: Category Document Removal ---

DoD 1.4: Remove TWS catalogueItem from Sanity
  □ OPEN: Sanity Studio > Catalogue Items
  □ DELETE: "True Wireless (TWS)" document (ID: sbbu2eig5fx84uht05ic863j)
  □ VERIFY: Document no longer appears in Studio
  □ TEST: Query returns null: *[_type == "catalogueItem" && _id == "sbbu2eig5fx84uht05ic863j"][0]

DoD 1.5: Update parent header children array
  □ EDIT: "In-Ear & Wireless" header (fxvwrl18sixw5b9ro2jrlepa)
  □ REMOVE: "sbbu2eig5fx84uht05ic863j" from children array
  □ VERIFY: Children array now has only 1 item (t2anvkkjfz9knqi85kozuaze)

--- LAYER 3: Semantic Configuration Cleanup ---

DoD 1.6: Remove TWS semantic rules
  □ EDIT: lib/catalogue/semanticConfig.ts
  □ REMOVE: 'true-wireless-tws' entry from SEMANTIC_CATEGORIES
  □ VERIFY: File length decreases by ~20 lines
  □ TEST: getSemanticRule('true-wireless-tws') returns null
  □ TEST: npx tsc --noEmit passes (no type errors)

DoD 1.7: Update semantic audit exclusion list (if exists)
  □ SEARCH: vfs-semantic-audit.mjs for TWS references
  □ REMOVE: Any hardcoded TWS checks or expectations
  □ TEST: Audit script runs without errors

--- LAYER 4: Build & Validation ---

DoD 1.8: Rebuild VFS index
  □ RUN: node scripts/build-catalogue-index.mjs
  □ VERIFY: Build succeeds (exit 0)
  □ VERIFY: data/catalogue-index.json updated
  □ CHECK: slotMetadataMap no longer contains TWS ID
  □ CHECK: slugToIdMap no longer contains "true-wireless-tws"
  □ CHECK: Leaf count decreased by 1 (from 20 to 19)

DoD 1.9: Post-removal regression test
  □ RUN: npx tsx tests/regression/catalogue-coherence-sprint.regression.test.ts
  □ EXPECT: TWS removal tests now PASS
  □ OUTPUT CAPTURE: Save to tests/regression/post-tws-removal.log

